  "result": "Done. I've fixed the security vulnerability. The bug was in the `findIssueById` function in the issue repository. It was accepting an `orgId` parameter but not using it to filter the query, allowing users to fetch issues from any organization by directly using their IDs.\n\nThe fix adds the organization scope check using `orgPredicate(issues.orgId, orgId)` to ensure that the query filters by both organization and issue ID, matching the pattern correctly used in `findIssueByNumber`. Now when a user from Organization A tries to access an issue belonging to Organization B, the query returns null and the app treats it as nonexistent.",
